# Node build inputs for the React IDE page. node_modules is ~40MB of third-party
# code that npm restores exactly from package-lock.json, and the built bundle
# under static/ui/dist is a build output: build_package.py rebuilds it from a
# clean checkout, so committing it would only create a second thing that can go
# stale. An earlier `git add -A` put 300-odd node_modules files in the index,
# which is what prompted this entry rather than a reason found afterwards.
src/rdebug_ide/static/ui/node_modules/
*.rdc.idx
tests/workload/corpus/
tests/workload/reports/

